&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 id="1-what-is-a-trait"&gt;1. What is a Trait?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A trait defines a set of behaviors (methods) that a type must implement. It is a &lt;strong&gt;contract&lt;/strong&gt; — any type that implements the trait promises to provide those behaviors.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>